# Lost Kingdom's edges. The headstone at status 0 without the vial: nothing; at status 2 (a GM): cutscene 9 even
# with no vial held (delKeyItem of a key item not held, then completed). The Jazaraat's death at status 0 (a GM moves
# status back): status stays 0 (only status 1 moves it).
lists CaedarvaMire/Jazaraats_Headstone/onTrigger CaedarvaMire/Jazaraat/onMobDeath CaedarvaMire/onEventFinish/9
char zone=CaedarvaMire pos=-385,6,-565 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Toau LostKingdom current
login
trigger Jazaraats_Headstone             # status 0, no vial: nothing
finish-if-event
missionstatus Toau 1                    # a GM
trigger Jazaraats_Headstone             # Jazaraat spawned
finish-if-event
missionstatus Toau 0                    # a GM
kill JAZARAAT                           # the death at status 0: nothing
missionstatus Toau 2                    # a GM
trigger Jazaraats_Headstone             # 9
finish                                  # completed
